			</heading>
			<begin-paragraph>
			</begin-paragraph>
			<v n="1">they will betray you .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v23033002">
			</marker>
			<v n="2">our salvation in the time of trouble .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v23033003">
			</marker>
